WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
Who are you?

2
00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:06.540
At 5, she knows exactly:
I'm 5, and I'm a big girl!

3
00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.020
At 15, it's harder: I don't know yet.

4
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.430
Maybe an artist?

5
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:16.220
At 50: a parent, a nurse,
someone who keeps promises.

6
00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.420
Same person, three very different answers.

7
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:21.520
So what builds a self?

8
00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:25.040
In this mission, you'll go right
back to a baby's first year,

9
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:29.100
and find out what it has to realise
before it can have a self at all.

10
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:33.770
And you'll find out whether believing
you're free to choose changes how you act.

11
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.630
Your mission: work out what builds a self,

12
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.840
from your first year to your fiftieth.
